":"Manaḥ-Śikṣā"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":63,"first_line":"ei-bāra karuṇā kara","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ei-bāra karuṇā kara vaiṣṇava gosāi","patita-pāvana tomā vine keha nāi"],"translation":["O worshippable Vaiṣṇava, be merciful to me this time. O saviour of the fallen, without you there is no one."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kāhāra nikaṭe gele pāpa dūre yāya","emana dayāla prabhu kebā kothā pāya"],"translation":["If one comes to you, one’s sins go away. Where can such a merciful master be found?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["gaṅgāra-paraśa ha-ile paśchāte pāvana","darśane pavitra kara—ei tomāra guṇa"],"translation":["If the Ganges touches someone, he is later purified, but you purify souls simply by seeing them—such is your power."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["hari-sthāne aparādhe tāre hari-nāma","tomā-sthāne aparādhe nāhika eḍāna"],"translation":["If one offends the Lord, the Lord’s Name delivers him, but if one offends you, one has no salvation."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["tomāra hṛdaye sadā govinda-viśrāma","govinda kahena—mama vaiṣṇava parāṇa"],"translation":["Govinda always resides in your heart, and He says, “My devotees are My heart.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["prati janme kari āśā charaṇera dhūli","narottame kara dayā āpnāra bali’"],"translation":["In every birth I aspire for the dust of your feet. Be merciful to Narottam, considering him your own."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-ei-baro-koruna","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-vaishnava","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ei-baro-koruna-koro_1","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Vaiṣṇava-Vijñāpti-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/ei-vara-karuna-kara-vaishnava-gosani/","description":"Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"ei-vara-karuna-kara-vaishnava-gosani"}}